    <label>Beast Breathing: Tenth Fang — Whirling Fangs</label>
    <description>Both swords spin in rapid overlapping circles, the blades becoming a blur that intercepts anything flying toward the user. Arrows, bolts, bullets — all of it deflected by the constant rotation of dual steel. A technique born not from training but from pure wild instinct.</description>
